hadiths[1]{hadithnumber,text}:
"15374","Haddathana Sufyan ibn Uyaynah, from Abd al-Karim, from Abd Allah ibn al-Harith, he said: My father married me during the rule of Uthman, and he invited some of the Companions of the Messenger of Allah (peace and blessings of Allah be upon him); Safwan ibn Umayyah came, an elderly old man, and said: The Messenger of Allah (peace and blessings of Allah be upon him) said: Tear meat with the front teeth, for it is more wholesome and more pleasant, or more tasty and more pleasant. Sufyan said: The doubt is from me or from him."
